Package: pve-storage-gdrive
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), rclone, fuse3, openssl, libjson-perl, libwww-perl, pve-manager (>= 8.0)
Description: Google Drive storage backend plugin for Proxmox VE
 Integrates Google Drive (My Drive and Shared Drives) as a native storage
 backend in Proxmox VE 8.x and 9.x for backups (vzdump), ISO images, and
 container templates.
 .
 Includes the pve-gdrived VFS/OAuth management daemon, Proxmox storage and
 REST API Perl plugins, Web UI integration with Easy Google Sign-In, and a
 synchronous vzdump backup verification hook.
